1545
01:18:19,330 --> 01:18:19,850
Ooh!

1546
01:18:20,090 --> 01:18:20,770
It's perfect!

1547
01:18:21,250 --> 01:18:22,290
Oh my god!

1548
01:18:23,370 --> 01:18:24,590
Christmas come early!

1549
01:18:26,010 --> 01:18:28,410
This is just getting straighter and straighter and...

1550
01:18:28,410 --> 01:18:29,350
longer and longer.

1551
01:18:29,890 --> 01:18:30,890
Like, I mean...

1552
01:18:30,890 --> 01:18:32,550
I guess that's one way to make rockets.

1553
01:18:33,310 --> 01:18:34,150
Not bad!

1554
01:18:34,370 --> 01:18:35,030
I like it.

1555
01:18:36,030 --> 01:18:37,230
I actually do like it.

1556
01:18:37,230 --> 01:18:38,050
I like it a lot.

1557
