Let's see these ones.

1558
01:18:41,130 --> 01:18:41,990
Is this too big?

1559
01:18:43,490 --> 01:18:44,310
I can't tell.

1560
01:18:46,050 --> 01:18:46,810
Is it too big?

1561
01:18:47,270 --> 01:18:48,250
Oh, it's too big!

1562
01:18:48,410 --> 01:18:48,570
No!

1563
