Why is it too big?

1564
01:18:50,830 --> 01:18:51,530
What's this one?

1565
01:18:52,150 --> 01:18:53,250
That's way too big!

1566
01:18:56,010 --> 01:18:56,750
Mega big!

1567
01:18:57,530 --> 01:18:59,670
Uh, wait, let me actually check all...

1568
