Oh, wait, wait.

1569
01:19:01,150 --> 01:19:03,590
Oh, wait a sec.

1570
01:19:04,850 --> 01:19:05,470
Hmm!

1571
01:19:08,450 --> 01:19:11,310
Maybe we can afford not to be super aerodynamic?

1572
01:19:14,630 --> 01:19:16,630
I actually kinda like.

1573
01:19:18,050 --> 01:19:18,770
Oh!

1574
01:19:23,210 --> 01:19:24,330
Oh my god!

1575
