Dude!

1582
01:19:39,370 --> 01:19:40,190
That's insane.

1583
01:19:43,190 --> 01:19:45,130
374 at sea level.

1584
01:19:47,070 --> 01:19:48,450
ISP is also pretty good.

1585
01:19:48,790 --> 01:19:50,170
It's like a good engine.

1586
01:19:51,030 --> 01:19:52,670
It's a good engine.

1587
01:19:53,290 --> 01:19:54,170
But this one.

1588
01:19:54,290 --> 01:19:54,810
600.

1589
01:19:55,050 --> 01:19:56,170
Holy crap.

1590
