Uh, you know what?

1595
01:20:12,300 --> 01:20:12,940
I'm actually...

1596
01:20:12,940 --> 01:20:14,580
I'm gonna stick to this very straight.

1597
01:20:14,900 --> 01:20:15,840
Thin rocket.

1598
01:20:16,040 --> 01:20:16,640
It's like a pencil.

1599
01:20:19,180 --> 01:20:19,580
Um...

1600
01:20:19,580 --> 01:20:21,620
Which fits, I guess, with Jebediah.

1601
01:20:21,780 --> 01:20:24,400
I mean, that's his nickname, you know, for reasons.

1602
01:20:24,820 --> 01:20:26,600
That only some Kerbalites know.

1603
01:20:27,200 --> 01:20:27,780
Just saying.

1604
01:20:28,500 --> 01:20:29,620
But, uh, it fits.

1605
01:20:30,460 --> 01:20:32,060
I'm gonna make this a little tinier.

1606
01:20:32,460 --> 01:20:34,380
Because we have a lot of speed here now, right?

1607
01:20:34,440 --> 01:20:35,780
We don't need to bring...

1608
