1612
01:20:48,960 --> 01:20:49,700
I mean, okay.

1613
01:20:49,840 --> 01:20:50,120
Check it out.

1614
01:20:50,300 --> 01:20:56,440
If the last rocket got us on a flyby, this will for sure take us in an orbit.

1615
01:20:56,840 --> 01:20:57,240
Right?

1616
01:20:57,940 --> 01:20:58,340
Boom.

1617
01:20:58,480 --> 01:20:59,180
It's as simple as that.

1618
01:20:59,440 --> 01:21:01,380
And this time, we're gonna bring science instruments.

1619
