Ah, but wait a minute.

1621
01:21:05,980 --> 01:21:08,840
Coming back down with that is gonna be troublesome.

1622
01:21:09,980 --> 01:21:10,780
Remember when...

1623
01:21:10,780 --> 01:21:11,760
I think it was with Bob.

1624
01:21:12,440 --> 01:21:13,980
We were in orbit around Kerbin.

1625
