But the shape of the re-entry capsule was super weird.

1628
01:21:21,380 --> 01:21:23,280
And we even lost some of the science.

1629
01:21:23,400 --> 01:21:24,760
It exploded on the way down.

1630
01:21:26,360 --> 01:21:29,240
Maybe this is where we need to start investing in antennas.

1631
01:21:29,960 --> 01:21:30,640
You know?

1632
01:21:31,360 --> 01:21:33,260
So we can transmit it instead.

1633
01:21:38,560 --> 01:21:40,280
We have a high-gain antenna.

1634
01:21:43,860 --> 01:21:48,120
I wonder if that means we can then get more science value.

1635
01:21:50,400 --> 01:21:51,040
Variance.

1636
01:21:51,300 --> 01:21:52,200
Radial axial?

1637
01:22:08,780 --> 01:22:09,700
Oh, that's cool.

1638
01:22:12,220 --> 01:22:13,060
Oh, that's dope.

1639
01:22:14,000 --> 01:22:14,300
Hmm.

1640
01:22:20,300 --> 01:22:21,820
I feel like we should just go.

1641
01:22:22,580 --> 01:22:23,440
We bring Bob.

1642
01:22:24,140 --> 01:22:24,600
Oh, wait.

1643
01:22:24,660 --> 01:22:24,960
Science.

1644
01:22:25,260 --> 01:22:26,120
