1645
01:22:26,920 --> 01:22:27,360
Tolerance.

1646
01:22:27,800 --> 01:22:28,040
Uh.

1647
01:22:28,180 --> 01:22:30,840
I guess what I used to do last time was...

1648
01:22:33,100 --> 01:22:33,780
This one.

1649
