1650
01:22:36,720 --> 01:22:39,120
It can tolerate 14 meters per second impact.

1651
01:22:39,300 --> 01:22:40,460
Which is actually kind of crazy.

1652
01:22:40,800 --> 01:22:43,400
Because usually we hit the ground at about 6 or 7.

1653
