I swear I wasn't trying to make like a joke there.

1654
01:22:47,100 --> 01:22:50,460
But we actually do hit the ground at around 6 or 7 meters per second.

1655
01:22:51,600 --> 01:22:54,000
And it can take up to 2,900 Kelvin.

1656
01:22:54,220 --> 01:22:55,120
