1658
01:22:59,460 --> 01:22:59,900
Capsule.

1659
01:23:01,820 --> 01:23:04,080
Oh, see that one is 2,200 Kelvin.

1660
01:23:04,220 --> 01:23:05,420
Okay, what about the...

1661
01:23:05,420 --> 01:23:05,520
Uh.

1662
01:23:09,780 --> 01:23:10,180
Oh, God.

1663
01:23:12,160 --> 01:23:12,980
3,300.

1664
01:23:13,240 --> 01:23:13,340
Oh.

1665
01:23:14,500 --> 01:23:16,400
So there is a max temperature.

1666
01:23:17,240 --> 01:23:19,600
It's not just about how much ablator there is.

1667
01:23:19,800 --> 01:23:20,940
Okay, that's actually good to know.

1668
01:23:21,900 --> 01:23:22,500
Very good.

1669
01:23:24,420 --> 01:23:24,860
Interesting.

1670
01:23:26,580 --> 01:23:27,580
There's three variants?

1671
01:23:27,760 --> 01:23:28,380
I didn't even notice.

1672
01:23:29,800 --> 01:23:30,680
How does that look?

1673
01:23:34,760 --> 01:23:35,200
Oh!

1674
01:23:36,000 --> 01:23:37,160
I like it being black.

1675
01:23:38,540 --> 01:23:39,320
Looks cool.

1676
01:23:41,040 --> 01:23:41,480
Neat.

1677
01:23:41,700 --> 01:23:43,380
But, I guess we don't want to do that right now.

1678
01:23:43,460 --> 01:23:44,980
Because we want to put it on some science.

1679
