5905
04:50:05,660 --> 04:50:06,580
It was just physics.

5906
04:50:07,200 --> 04:50:07,760
You know?

5907
04:50:08,520 --> 04:50:11,400
And I was just completely consumed by it.

5908
04:50:12,540 --> 04:50:20,460
and then because I started getting consumed by it, I started, you know, consuming a bunch of pop literature or what's it called?

5909
04:50:22,120 --> 04:50:23,920
Popular science, you know?

5910
04:50:24,300 --> 04:50:25,140
Like Carl Sagan.

5911
04:50:25,540 --> 04:50:26,720
I read his books.

5912
04:50:27,940 --> 04:50:30,500
A candle, or science is a candle in the dark.

5913
04:50:30,700 --> 04:50:32,020
It's one of my favorites from him.

5914
04:50:33,740 --> 04:50:35,640
Cosmos, of course, the TV series.

5915
04:50:36,560 --> 04:50:43,340
Man, after watching that TV series, I, at that point, I knew I was gonna do something with space, you know?

5916
04:50:43,960 --> 04:50:45,680
I was just like, I was feeling it.

5917
04:50:46,640 --> 04:50:48,280
Man, those years were crazy.

5918
04:50:50,020 --> 04:50:51,360
I ate it all up, man.

5919
04:50:53,120 --> 04:50:55,080
They were like golden years of my life, really.

5920
04:50:56,520 --> 04:51:00,020
