5925
04:51:14,480 --> 04:51:16,140
I was consuming like a madman.

5926
04:51:16,640 --> 04:51:18,060
Those were the golden years, man.

5927
04:51:18,460 --> 04:51:26,140
I would lay out on the grass at night, you know, staring up at the sky, with my arms outstretched, feeling, you know, the surface of the earth.

5928
04:51:26,140 --> 04:51:31,740
It was almost like if you lay down like that and look up, that you could feel the rotation of the earth.

5929
04:51:32,800 --> 04:51:35,160
